<title>Somalia: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/somalia/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-somalia-2026-11-08T19:49:46.929Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sun, 08 Nov 2026 19:49:46 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Somalia's Supreme Court rejected President Hassan Sheikh Mohamud's term extension, prompting armed forces to seize the court and threats to the chief's life. Security forces opened fire on protesters in Mogadishu, killing at least three civilians in clashes over home demolitions and two others in separate police shootings. Government troops were attacked near Leego town and Somali soldiers were left unburied after a deadly al-Shabaab clash, while the police deputy chief warned of a security vacuum as Ugandan troops withdraw. The conflict caused 2,284 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirwFBVV95cUxNMWFXZE53Y1NVelM1ZmljRDh3R3JGOHVlME1BZzZ1NmVlZHhHRmNCOEdjLVhobEtMYnVVM181QlNwYWhHM3hhNlBMT25vUjVnUTNYNlRSaFNOb2xMeEJpOUg1M1FfZzZoMzVWNTRKbnpEeUY0MkR1d0VKUmw0OHoxa3hwM0tfVlBVTXNSamVkNGtFVnJYZlM5SFNXUjJ1VDI5SFd5OVNSaWZwbzkydmdF?oc=5&quot;&gt;Bloomberg.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiW0FVX3lxTE1SVFpORU5zQkRLVkp2OWNJWGplQWhXeFE5NkN4UXpOSGtzaVZNUzBfRXZ5cUxKMDliWGZ6a2I3bVMyRko4MlphZmpPdXgyVnRRcHlwdF96ZmxLems?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixAFBVV95cUxQalQ0WGNrVjJCT1loUllTajVxLS1yWnJVZHJZeDh6UUc4aS1zb1lHMzJucXFJdmpHZnY2UGtMX1JRMWRGSlpKQ1kwWFEzZ2plVWE5cnp5RHJFREE4X0l0Y3l0MGRZcVlPNDF4aWIxV3BFMElwaWx3M3hzR2FFbTUzeXVhT1ZRVlAySV9US1F5RWthX0VJb0NoOTlTclVWSklMT0dBOS1NcHZmblFRMWpGUWFVV1JPa3Y4SVEwVFYtQXc4U04w?oc=5&quot;&gt;Hiiraan Online&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMif0FVX3lxTE5RSjVXYzA0eFVTVEFaQ0NHdnM1NGFDWklfUm4yR09vQ2NJSUloT2ZFMDA4a0FUckhrN0tNMHk4QmV5RDRQdjJsaTljblZyYjJZaXFnVmdpcV9EM2k2SmF6eTZlbnRLOHlTQ1g0dUhJZnA0eUtWT0RvMkxROGRQRDQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;APAnews - Agence de Presse Africaine&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.